---
description: Sub2Video UI and component ownership rules
globs: ["**/*.vue", "**/*.ts", "**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Before editing UI, read `docs/ui/design-system.md`, then the matching HTML
surface in `docs/原型设计/sub2video-client.html` or
`docs/原型设计/sub2video-admin.html`.

- Visual chrome follows those HTML files. Menus and object model follow
  `docs/产品方案总览.md`. Do not copy HTML-only names (创作台 / 作品集) into Vue.
- Use `shared/ui` components before writing new markup.
- Pages may compose layout utilities, but may not define visual decisions.
- Do not use arbitrary Tailwind values or raw color literals in business code.
- Do not override S2V component visuals with `class` from a page.
- Add a component variant only when two or more business surfaces need it.
- Put client/admin theme differences in design tokens, not duplicated page CSS.
- GPU / online / success states use success green on both surfaces.
- Run typecheck, lint, and the relevant browser/visual checks after changes.
